  "side": "All side-view frames face screen-RIGHT (visually audited per frame in sideFacing). The renderer (drawBarbarian in src/game/iso/barbarian.ts) mirrors the side art when facing=left. BUILD 393: fixed reversed left/right \u2014 the art natively faced right but the renderer only mirrored when facing=right, so walking left showed right-facing art. Also re-mirrored the 5 bow side frames (BUILD 391 had normalized them face-left) and sword_side_walk_1 (BUILD 392 had mirrored it face-left) back to the face-right pack convention. BUILD 397: bare side idle/walk re-cut per user direction from the user-supplied left-facing sheet (mirrored to the face-right pack convention; the renderer mirrors for left, so left movement shows the user's original left-facing art).",
